# File: target/sshd_config
# Author: Team LARP
# Revision date: 2026-11-12
# Version: 0.1.0
# Purpose: sshd policy for the disposable SSH response target.
#
# Password authentication stays enabled so failed password attempts produce the
# authentication_failed events used by the Wazuh sshd ruleset. No SSH port is
# published to the host; only the private Docker networks can reach it.

Port 22
AddressFamily inet
ListenAddress 0.0.0.0
PermitRootLogin no
PubkeyAuthentication yes
PasswordAuthentication yes
KbdInteractiveAuthentication no
PermitEmptyPasswords no
UsePAM yes
X11Forwarding no
AllowAgentForwarding no
AllowTcpForwarding no
PermitTunnel no
PrintMotd no
UseDNS no
LogLevel VERBOSE
MaxAuthTries 6
LoginGraceTime 20
